@HostAddress = https://localhost:55648
@WebhookToken = futurekawa-webhook-shared-token

### Auth: Login (nécessaire pour relire les orders via les endpoints JWT)
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@futurekawa.com",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

### Odoo webhook: réception d'une commande confirmée (simule action_confirm() côté Odoo)
# @name receiveOrder
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/integration/odoo/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Token: {{WebhookToken}}

{
  "orderId": 1001,
  "orderDate": "2026-08-27T10:00:00Z",
  "client": "Café Import SARL",
  "country": "BR",
  "qualityGrade": "A",
  "batchReferences": ["BATCH-001", "BATCH-002"],
  "lines": [
    { "product": "Café Arabica", "quantity": 500 },
    { "product": "Café Robusta", "quantity": 250 }
  ]
}

### Odoo webhook: même commande rejouée (doit être idempotent, "already exists" dans les logs)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/integration/odoo/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Token: {{WebhookToken}}

{
  "orderId": 1001,
  "orderDate": "2026-08-27T10:00:00Z",
  "client": "Café Import SARL",
  "country": "BR",
  "qualityGrade": "A",
  "batchReferences": ["BATCH-001", "BATCH-002"],
  "lines": [
    { "product": "Café Arabica", "quantity": 500 },
    { "product": "Café Robusta", "quantity": 250 }
  ]
}

### Odoo webhook: mauvais token (doit renvoyer 401)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/integration/odoo/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Token: wrong-token

{
  "orderId": 1002,
  "orderDate": "2026-08-27T10:00:00Z",
  "client": "Test Client",
  "country": "EC",
  "qualityGrade": "B",
  "batchReferences": ["BATCH-003"],
  "lines": [
    { "product": "Café Robusta", "quantity": 100 }
  ]
}

### Orders: lister toutes les commandes reçues d'Odoo
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Orders: récupérer la commande créée ci-dessus par son id interne
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{receiveOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}